{"unit_id":"tag:06T7:statement","translation":"存在预形变范畴（predeformation categories），它们有满足（<REF_0001>）的万有形式对象（versal formal object），却不满足 (S2)。一个简便的例子是取 <MATH_0001>，其中 <MATH_0002> 是有限（finite）非平凡（nontrivial）子群（subgroup）。也就是说，映射（map）<MATH_0003> 是光滑的（smooth），但切空间（tangent space），对于 <MATH_0004> 而言，并不具有自然的 <MATH_0005>-向量空间（vector space）结构（因为它是某个 <MATH_0006>-向量空间（vector space）按有限（finite）群（group）所取的商（quotient））。\n","allowed_english":["S"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"predeformation categories","target_term":"预形变范畴"},{"source_term":"versal formal object","target_term":"万有形式对象"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"nontrivial","target_term":"非平凡"},{"source_term":"subgroup","target_term":"子群"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的"},{"source_term":"tangent space","target_term":"切空间"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"predeformation categories","target_term":"预形变范畴","context":"不满足 (S2) 的例子，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"versal formal object","target_term":"万有形式对象","context":"满足轨道双射条件的对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"群及子群的阶数，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"nontrivial","target_term":"非平凡","context":"子群的性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"subgroup","target_term":"子群","context":"对偶数自同构群的子群，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"到商函子的映射，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的","context":"该映射的性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"tangent space","target_term":"切空间","context":"商函子的切空间，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间","context":"切空间缺失的结构及取商前的空间，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"作用的有限群，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商","context":"向量空间按群作用取商，暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06T8:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是满足 (S2) 的预形变范畴（predeformation category），并具有万有形式对象（versal formal object）。那么其极小（minimal）万有形式对象（versal formal object）满足（<REF_0001>）。\n","allowed_english":["S"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"predeformation category","target_term":"预形变范畴"},{"source_term":"versal formal object","target_term":"万有形式对象"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小"},{"source_term":"versal formal object","target_term":"万有形式对象"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"predeformation category","target_term":"预形变范畴","context":"满足 (S2) 的范畴，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"versal formal object","target_term":"万有形式对象","context":"假设存在及极小对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小","context":"按前节定义的极小性，暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
